# File Path: /.dockerignore
# Description: Safety boundary for any explicit root-context Docker build.
# Main Features:
#   - Excludes secrets, generated releases and runtime state
#   - Keeps build artifacts and local dependencies out of image layers

.git/
.env
.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/logs/
**/plans/
**/.env.docker.smoke
**/storage/
**/uploads/
**/exports/
backend/data/
release/out/
runtime/
resources/
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.zip
*.dump
*.sql.gz
*.sql
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
